        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=`You are an AI Customer Engagement Analyst.\n\nAnalyze the following customer and determine their engagement risk level.\n\nCurrent Customer Data:\n\nCustomer Name: {{ $json.name }}\nDays Since Last Activity: {{ $json.last_active_days }}\nNumber of Support Tickets: {{ $json.support_tickets }}\nSubscription Plan: {{ $json.subscription_plan }}\n\nPrevious Customer Analysis:\n\nPrevious Risk Level: {{ $json.previous_risk_level }}\nPrevious Reason: {{ $json.previous_reason }}\nPrevious Recommended Action: {{ $json.previous_recommended_action }}\n\nAnalyze the customer's current situation and compare it with the previous analysis.\n\nDetermine whether the customer's engagement has improved, worsened, or remained stable. Use the previous analysis as context, but base the risk classification primarily on the current customer data.\nClassify the customer using exactly one of these three risk levels:\n\nHEALTHY - The customer appears actively engaged and has no significant concerns.\n\nAT_RISK - The customer shows signs of declining engagement and may need proactive follow-up.\n\nURGENT - The customer has serious engagement or support concerns requiring immediate attention.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"risk_level\": \"HEALTHY\",\n  \"reason\": \"Brief explanation referencing the customer's actual data\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Specific action to take\"\n}\n\nThe risk_level value must be exactly one of:\nHEALTHY\nAT_RISK\nURGENT\n\nDo not include markdown formatting or any text outside the JSON.\n\nAnalyze the customer's current situation and compare it with the previous analysis.\n\nDetermine whether the customer's engagement has:\n\n- IMPROVED\n- WORSENED\n- REMAINED_STABLE\n\nUse the previous analysis as historical context, but make your risk assessment based primarily on the current customer data.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"risk_level\": \"HEALTHY\",\n  \"reason\": \"Explain the current customer risk assessment.\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Describe the recommended action.\",\n  \"engagement_trend\": \"IMPROVED\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
