        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a customer data validation system.\n\nAnalyze the following incoming customer submission and determine whether it is a legitimate customer entry.\n\nCustomer data:\n\nName: {{ $json.body.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.body.email }}\nLast active days: {{ $json.body.last_active_days }}\nSupport tickets: {{ $json.body.support_tickets }}\nSubscription plan: {{ $json.body.subscription_plan }}\n\nClassify the entry using exactly one of these categories:\n\nVALID\n- Appears to be legitimate customer data.\n\nSPAM\n- Contains obvious nonsense, suspicious, irrelevant, or clearly fraudulent information.\n\nTEST_ENTRY\n- Appears to be a demonstration, test, placeholder, or intentionally fake submission.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"classification\": \"VALID\",\n  \"reason\": \"Brief explanation\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
